From dbcc04c41ffcb82348cf4d0bea105a6d9be61ffd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Horizon authors <>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 10:24:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Tamer looks: the Look page opens with a girl

The hands' row is no longer shown, but the page still drew its value when it opened, and a girl's read a name past
the garments' table: the page hung. That row has no value now.
---
 src/main/game_menu.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/main/game_menu.c b/src/main/game_menu.c
index cd0cb2e..ac0a20d 100644
--- a/src/main/game_menu.c
+++ b/src/main/game_menu.c
@@ -2745,7 +2745,7 @@ static char *lookPageValueText(int32_t row)
 	int32_t value = lookPageGet(row);
 	int32_t name;
 
-	if (!lookPageRowOpen(row)) {
+	if (row == LOOK_HANDS_ROW || !lookPageRowOpen(row)) { /* the hands' row is not shown and has no names */
 		return (char *)lookPageDash;
 	}
 	switch (row) {
-- 
